{"meta":{"id":"tt32149571","type":"series","name":"Golden Axe","description":"Los legendarios guerreros Ax Battler, Tyris Flare y Gilius Thunderhead se reúnen para salvar a Yuria del malvado gigante Death Adder, que parece no querer quedarse muerto. Su misión se complica por Hampton Squib, un aventurero inexperto y tremendamente mal preparado cuyo sueño de heroísmo supera con creces sus habilidades. Obligados a trabajar juntos a pesar de sus defectos, deben encontrar la manera de detener a Death Adder de una vez por todas.","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/toEwR5VTFzHmxW1pX1HjtTXH6QH.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zOcEo3oQf9KDPPxZueNhReN6TBr.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1HwmReqhvTkTMQRcPJq7TLtb4kW.png","genres":["Animación","Sci-Fi & Fantasy"],"releaseInfo":"2026","released":"2026-09-16T00:00:00.000Z","imdbRating":"7.9","runtime":"20 min","trailers":[{"source":"sStbBtfGaLA","type":"Trailer"}],"cast":["Matthew Rhys","Danny Pudi","Lisa Gilroy","Liam McIntyre","Carl Tart"],"director":["Mike McMahan","Joe Chandler"],"writer":[],"links":[{"name":"Matthew Rhys","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Matthew%20Rhys"},{"name":"Danny Pudi","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Danny%20Pudi"},{"name":"Lisa Gilroy","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Lisa%20Gilroy"},{"name":"Liam McIntyre","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Liam%20McIntyre"},{"name":"Carl Tart","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Carl%20Tart"},{"name":"Mike McMahan","category":"Directors","url":"stremio:///search?search=Mike%20McMahan"},{"name":"Joe Chandler","category":"Directors","url":"stremio:///search?search=Joe%20Chandler"}],"app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Matthew Rhys","character":"Gilius Thunderhead (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w276_and_h350_face/8uktKexgPn0tsW3dsXVNqkqiNh7.jpg","tmdbId":29528},{"name":"Danny Pudi","character":"Hampton Squib (voice)","photo":"https://ima